<title>UK: Achmea Hypo sets 200 million guilder 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Achmea Hypo sets 200 million guilder 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ACHMEA HYPOTHEEKBANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DFL   COUPON     6.75 PCT  MATURITY    25.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.33    PAY DATE    25.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    99.83     SPREAD	+77.5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-10	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     MGT/UND    0.50 PCT  SELL CONC   1.50 PCT</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED JUNE 8.50 PCT 2006 AND</p>
<p>		JANUARY 8.75 PCT 2007 DSLS</p>
<p>NOTES	LAUNCHED IN COMBINATIONA WITH A 200 MLN DFL SENIOR</p>
<p>		DEBT PRIVATE PLACEMENT OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
